    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6087a040a9468bf10d113ef6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "向无声铃鹿施下\\n能够畅快奔跑的魔咒\\n让她更好的发挥自己的能力",
      "source_fingerprint": "53d72ac81742037a6934fc2a7a7f7327693179139929bcb807fcb8e2333c1ba8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300081"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/300081"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a4e6500ea3e1eab83500d68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿终于找到独属于自己的跑法\\n并将之化为对亲友的激励\\n无声铃鹿的能力能更好地发挥",
      "source_fingerprint": "38095beabdae8748731cbcb2410c40ccdfb3859d394868eab9daf3a214a24ae3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300091"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/300091"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9066308a208ef06e33b7aed7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后段的弯道上\\n无声铃鹿感受到众人的祈愿\\n因此恢复耐力",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b60014a40b7b4b318d6489ee81e0c647648223980116d6a2856602a3250be50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
